  "notes": "מה קורה (makore.co.il) — Israeli events aggregator (Next.js, Cloudflare). Every /browse/category/<x> page carries a schema.org ItemList of 28 Events (date-ascending) with url = the makore event page, offers.url = the SELLER (goshow / tickchak / municipal box office …) → prefer_offer_url, Place with streetAddress + Hebrew addressLocality (city_aliases; a few rows only have 'venue , city' in location.name and fall to Tel Aviv), startDate as UTC 'Z' (converted to Asia/Jerusalem by the engine). Pagination is the ?pages=N query string (page_param; 'עמוד הבא' link) — events shift pages daily, hence id_seed=url. 7 categories × ≤25 pages ≈ 175 requests / ~4,900 rows per run; horizon ≈ 4–6 weeks for concerts/theatre, months for stand-up. Workshops / tours / exhibitions / cinema categories are deliberately left out (daily-recurring hobby listings). No performer field → artist_name empty. robots: Allow / (Crawl-delay only for SEO bots). Not tested from Render: if Cloudflare 403s Render's IP add \"relay\": \"mac\". Dry run 2026-09-20 (7 × 4 pages): 746 events, city 95 %, price 51 %, no images; 170/746 already in prod (mevalim 118, goshow 33)."
